<title>UK: M &amp; S buys Edinburgh centre for 122 mln stg.</title>
<headline>M &amp; S buys Edinburgh centre for 122 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>British retailer Marks and Spencer Plc said on Thursday it has agreed to buy the Gyle Shopping Centre in Edinburgh, Scotland from the City of Edinburgh Council for 122.15 million stg.</p>
<p>It said in a statment that it has an existing 78,700 square feet store within the centre.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
